@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
hide footbox

actor "宿主业务服务" as Host
participant "定义/执行 API" as API
database "引擎三表" as Store
participant "后台规划与调度" as Runtime
participant "业务 Handler" as Handler
database "业务资源与产物" as Business

== 定义与受理 ==
Host -> API : create(command, caller)
API -> Handler : validate(configuration, caller)
Handler --> API : 校验通过
API -> Store : 保存 Job
API --> Host : JobView
Host -> API : execute(command, caller)
API -> Store : 幂等准入 + JobExecution + JobSnapshot
API --> Host : ExecutionReceipt（已受理）

== 异步规划 ==
Runtime -> Handler : plan(context, sink)
Handler -> Business : 解析对象/模板/算子版本
Business --> Handler : 固定的业务引用
Handler -> Runtime : setResolvedInputObjects + addBatch
Runtime -> Store : 分批保存 PENDING Task
Handler --> Runtime : plan 正常结束
Runtime -> Store : 封存有效计划，进入 RUNNING

== 有界并发执行 ==
loop 每个 Task；实际执行受并发上限约束
  Runtime -> Store : 比较状态并领取 Task
  Runtime -> Handler : execute(TaskContext)
  Handler -> Business : 查询 effectKey 并幂等保存产物
  Business --> Handler : 业务版本引用
  Handler --> Runtime : TaskResult
  Runtime -> Store : 同一事务更新 Task 终态及计数
end
Runtime -> Store : 汇总执行终态与结束时间

== 查询结果 ==
Host -> API : getExecution / listTasks / statistics
API -> Store : 查询持久化状态与输出引用
Store --> API : 执行及任务记录
API --> Host : DTO / Page / Statistics
Host -> Business : 按输出版本 ID 查询资产、元数据或血缘
Business --> Host : 文件信息或图谱结果
@enduml
